  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provision of Assistive Products to Older People with Disabilities in Northwest Syria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The wellbeing, mobility and independence of 375 Older Person with Disability (OPWD) in the target locations (NW Syria)  have improved after the provision of Assistive Products. The budget is 3,101 K GBP and is planned to complement HUT715 and HUT716 project. As the fund is small, we allocated 100% to direct cost.</narrative>
